# Ygg native runtime for __TARGET__

This package contains the exact-version native `ygg` and `ygg-host` binaries
for **__TARGET__**, together with Ygg's packaged `README.md`, `docs/`,
`examples/`, and `sdk/` resources under `share/ygg/`.

It is an implementation package selected by `@skaft-software/ygg`. Install the
public launcher rather than selecting a platform package by hand. This package
has no dependencies or lifecycle scripts and its binaries never resolve or
download another package at runtime:

```sh
npm install --global --ignore-scripts --no-audit --no-fund @skaft-software/ygg@VERSION
```
